# PerfectPioneer / KUKURAT HTTP/3 RATs — Suricata Detection Rules
# Campaign: TGR-STA-0049 targeting Southeast Asian governments
# Reference: https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/custom-rats-target-southeast-asia-governments/
# Generated: 2026-11-17 | Version: 1.1 (revised)
# Validation: suricata -T exit 0 (Suricata 7.0.3)
# Notes: DNS rules use dns.query sticky buffer. HTTP rules use http.uri + http.host.
#        All 9 known C2 domains covered. QUIC IP payload rules dropped (unreliable on encrypted traffic).

# --- DNS queries to known C2 domains (all 9) ---

